                "type": "OUTPUT",
                "translations": {
                  "es_ES": {
                    "text": "Al mediodía — Si eres el primer jugador, tu expedición del héroe [ASCENDS]. (Hasta el descanso, puede avanzar aunque los terrenos de su región estén igualados con los de la expedición del oponente.)",
                    "locale": "es_ES"
                  },
                  "en_US": {
                    "text": "At Noon — If you are first player, your Hero Expedition [ASCENDS]. (Until Rest, it can move forward even if matched in its region's terrains by the opponent's Expedition.)",
                    "locale": "en_US"
                  },
                  "it_IT": {
                    "text": "A mezzogiorno — Se sei il primo giocatore, la spedizione del tuo eroe [ASCENDS]. (Fino al riposo, può avanzare anche se i terreni della sua regione eguagliano quelli della spedizione dell'avversario.)",
                    "locale": "it_IT"
                  },
                  "fr_FR": {
                    "text": "À Midi — Si vous êtes le premier joueur, votre Expédition Héros [ASCENDS]. (Jusqu'au Repos, elle peut avancer même en cas de stats égales à l'Expédition adverse sur les terrains de sa région.)",
                    "locale": "fr_FR"
                  },
                  "de_DE": {
                    "text": "Zum Mittag — Falls du der Startspieler bist, ist deine Helden-Expedition [ASCENDS]. (Kann sich bis zur Ruhepause vorwärts bewegen, selbst falls beide über gleich viele Gelände in den Regionen verfügen.)",
                    "locale": "de_DE"
                  }
                },
                "text": "At Noon — If you are first player, your Hero Expedition [ASCENDS]. (Until Rest, it can move forward even if matched in its region's terrains by the opponent's Expedition.)"
              }
            ],
            "reference": "01525"
          },
          "sequence": 0,
          "id": "01KGQDVBEYFR8N0EWZCMVG4878"
        },
        {
          "cardElement": "\/card_elements\/01KGQDVARPSRB5QWD29BYMH1AM",
          "cardEffect": {
            "cardEffectElements": [
              {
                "idGd": 0,
                "cardEffectElementDisplays": [],
                "type": "OUTPUT",
                "translations": {
                  "en_US": {
                    "text": "When one or more of your Ascended Expeditions moves forward — If there is no Character facing it, draw a card.",
                    "locale": "en_US"
                  },
                  "es_ES": {
                    "text": "Cuando una o más de tus expediciones ascendidas avancen — Si no hay ningún personaje enfrentado a ellas, roba una carta.",
                    "locale": "es_ES"
                  },
                  "fr_FR": {
                    "text": "Lorsqu'au moins une de vos Expéditions Élevées avance — S'il n'y a aucun Personnage qui lui fait face, piochez une carte.",
                    "locale": "fr_FR"
                  },
                  "de_DE": {
                    "text": "Wenn sich mindestens eine deiner Aufgestiegenen Expeditionen vorwärts bewegt — Falls es ihr gegenüber keinen Charakter gibt, ziehe eine Karte.",
                    "locale": "de_DE"
                  },
                  "it_IT": {
                    "text": "Quando una o più delle tue spedizioni Ascese avanzano — Se non ci sono personaggi che le affrontano, pesca una carta.",
                    "locale": "it_IT"
                  }
                },
                "text": "When one or more of your Ascended Expeditions moves forward — If there is no Character facing it, draw a card."
              }
            ],
            "reference": "01400"
          },
          "sequence": 1,
          "id": "01KGQDVC1Z32KXP9SJWP36XWEQ"
        }
      ],
      "value": "At Noon — If you are first player, your Hero Expedition [Ascends]. (Until Rest, it can move forward even if matched in its region's terrains by the opponent's Expedition.)  When one or more of your Ascended Expeditions moves forward — If there is no Character facing it, draw a card.",
